            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/e01cf3df17cc111ac2ed9d318f76d9c4.poster.avif?t=1783953648\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/e01cf3df17cc111ac2ed9d318f76d9c4.webm?t=1783953648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/e01cf3df17cc111ac2ed9d318f76d9c4.mp4?t=1783953648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Prepare-se para um confronto intergaláctico como nunca antes no melhor jogo de festa multijogador que coloca amigos e familiares uns contra os outros em uma briga cósmica em ritmo acelerado. Corra para a vitória em uma infinidade de modos de batalha totalmente personalizáveis. Personalize partidas e desencadeie o caos com um arsenal totalmente carregado de armas letais, incluindo uma seleção impressionante de armas de fogo, foguetes, lasers e lâminas corpo a corpo.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/9a8888b72cde3413463dcd2b5fc05ce8.poster.avif?t=1783953648\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/9a8888b72cde3413463dcd2b5fc05ce8.webm?t=1783953648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/9a8888b72cde3413463dcd2b5fc05ce8.mp4?t=1783953648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Junte-se e jogue em uma variedade de minijogos esportivos de alta energia, incluindo futebol, queimada e futebol americano!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/4a649451b9c8d0875f8cd647227f5ee7.poster.avif?t=1783953648\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/4a649451b9c8d0875f8cd647227f5ee7.webm?t=1783953648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/4a649451b9c8d0875f8cd647227f5ee7.mp4?t=1783953648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>É perfeito para sua próxima festa, reunião ou sarau!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/bb80e0f1811e94256ed6925cb0740d4b.poster.avif?t=1783953648\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/bb80e0f1811e94256ed6925cb0740d4b.webm?t=1783953648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/bb80e0f1811e94256ed6925cb0740d4b.mp4?t=1783953648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Características</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Continue a festa com 9 modos de jogo exclusivos<br></li><li>Torne-se imparável com 16 armas letais<br></li><li>Incremente as partidas com 6 caixas de itens especiais<br></li><li>Corra pela galáxia em 16 níveis diferentes<br></li><li>Ganhe 21 bônus desbloqueáveis, desde armas até modos de jogo<br></li><li>Desafie amigos ou enfrente oponentes de IA com 5 níveis de dificuldade de CPU<br></li><li>Desfrute de 21 faixas de 8 artistas incríveis na Trilha Sonora Original</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/754a989409b1fd6439343ec299fd9038.poster.avif?t=1783953648\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/754a989409b1fd6439343ec299fd9038.webm?t=1783953648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/754a989409b1fd6439343ec299fd9038.mp4?t=1783953648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modos de jogo</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Death Match - O primeiro a obter a pontuação desejada vence!<br></li><li>Time Match - A melhor pontuação na campainha vence!<br></li><li>Stock Match - Última bolha em pé!<br></li><li>Combo King - Continue com esse combo!<br></li><li>Dojo - Modo Sandbox para ficar impressionado!<br></li><li>Futebol - Dash Attacks são um jogo justo!<br></li><li>Bombardeio - Dodgeball com Canhões!<br></li><li>Blitz - Futebol, mas mais rápido!<br></li><li>Food Fight - Pegue o maior número de tacos para ganhar!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/893bc49bb11b59273efe299a096aad13.poster.avif?t=1783953648\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/893bc49bb11b59273efe299a096aad13.webm?t=1783953648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/893bc49bb11b59273efe299a096aad13.mp4?t=1783953648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>O jogo também apresenta uma trilha sonora original apresentando 21 faixas excelentes de 8 artistas brilhantes, incluindo Chris Huelsbeck, Paul O’Rourke e Zac Zinger, além de uma sinfonia de efeitos sonoros habilmente elaborados pelo lendário designer de som Jory Prum.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/e5176d8abe5d1d5ebdf2e6933ef9e26a.poster.avif?t=1783953648\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/e5176d8abe5d1d5ebdf2e6933ef9e26a.webm?t=1783953648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/e5176d8abe5d1d5ebdf2e6933ef9e26a.mp4?t=1783953648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/446510/extras/25292b923fdf1ce9e001af446824da5d.webp?t=1783953648\" width=600 height=30 /></span>",
